Package: wanglinux-theme
Version: 1.0.1-1~aurora2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: WangLinux Project <dev@wanglinux.example>
Installed-Size: 640
Depends: desktop-file-utils
Suggests: xfce4, lightdm-gtk-greeter
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Description: WangLinux Aurora visual identity
 Default wallpaper (1920x1080), the "Aurora" GTK3 accent theme, the LightDM
 greeter configuration and an XFCE autostart hook that applies the wallpaper
 on every login. Pure data package - safe on any Debian 12 desktop.
